{"text": "PROTOCOL 1601.004\n\nStudy Nuaber _I-2481.004 Initiation Date _Noveaber 13, 1984\n\nCompletion Date November 15, 1984\n\nCOMPARATIVE TOXICITY OF TEST CIGARETTE SMOKE WITH\nREFERENCE CIGARETTE SMOKE AFTER INHALATION IN MALE AND FEMALE RATS\n(D16 and 028)\n\n1.0 PURPOSE\n\nThe purpose of this study is to compare the toxicity of saoke from\ntwo test cigarettes with the reference cigarette using two reference\nsaoke doses (RSD1 and RSD2) previously deterained.\n\n2.0 RATIONALE\n\nPrevious studies have determined the survival and toxicity of doses\nand exposure regiaens for reference cigarette smoke. One of these\ndoses (RSD1) has been shown to result in 100% survival after a single\nday's exposure and aver 14 days\u2019 repeated exposure. Another of these\ndoses (RSD2) has been shown to be toxic to naive animals after a\nSingle day's exposure, while not toxic to adapted anieals. Thus,\nthese two doses and exposure regiaens will be used with two test\ncigarettes to compare survival, body weight change, carboxyheaoglobin\n(CDHB) Levels and physical observations with the reference cigarette.\n\n3.0 SPONSOR\n\n3.1 Name: Lorillard Research Center\n\n3.2 Address: 420 English Street, P.0. Box 21688\nGreensboro, North Carolina 27420\n\n3.3. Authorized Representative: H. Minneaeyer\nCc. Stone\n\n4,0. TESTING FACILITY\n\n4.4 Name: Departaent of Inhalation Toxicology;\nMicrobiological Associates Inc.\n\n4.2 Address: 5221 River Road\nBethesda, Maryland 20816\n\n4.3. Study Director: R.M. David\n1\n\nS9SLe6688", "words": [{"text": "PROTOCOL", "x0": 306, "y0": 141, "x1": 360, "y1": 150, "conf": 92.0}, {"text": "1601.004", "x0": 370, "y0": 141, "x1": 423, "y1": 150, "conf": 90.0}, {"text": "Study", "x0": 95, "y0": 184, "x1": 128, "y1": 195, "conf": 91.0}, {"text": "Nuaber", "x0": 136, "y0": 184, "x1": 176, "y1": 193, "conf": 69.0}, {"text": "_I-2481.004", "x0": 194, "y0": 183, "x1": 262, "y1": 193, "conf": 44.0}, {"text": "Initiation", "x0": 329, "y0": 183, "x1": 395, "y1": 1